 "quickstart": [
  "Mascots: read https://icongems.kuige.me/data/ipas-logos.json → 512px preview /ipas/display/<key>.webp → 1024px original /ipas/full/<key>.webp (all on this site, MIT).",
  "Avatars: pick a style from avatar_studio.styles → share https://icongems.kuige.me/?avatar=<style>:<seed> (generated client-side, vendored DiceBear).",
  "Illustrations: read https://icongems.kuige.me/data/illus.json → /illus/3d/<slug>.png or /illus/ill/<file>.png (CC0/MIT).",
  "Icon names: GET https://icongems.kuige.me/data/icon-index.json (names grouped by prefix + per-set chunk layout).",
  "Icon SVG data: Icon data is hash-chunked: for icon <prefix>:<name>, k = djb2_utf8(name) % K (K = byPrefix.<prefix>.k in the index; djb2_utf8: h=5381; for each UTF-8 byte b: h=(h*33+b) mod 2^32). Fetch https://icongems.kuige.me/icons/<prefix>.<k>.json and read .icons[<name>] = {body, width?, height?}; set-level width/height are the fallback dimensions. SVG = <svg xmlns viewBox=\"0 0 W H\"> + body + </svg>.",
  "Embed icons in web apps via @iconify/react, @iconify/vue or <iconify-icon> web component (npm packages use the same prefixes).",
  "Check the license field before shipping; CC BY 4.0 sets need attribution."
 ],
